 "text": "Every Saturday, our town holds a market in the main square. Farmers bring fruit, vegetables and eggs from nearby villages. There are stalls with bread, cheese and flowers. I like the market for many reasons. The food is fresh, and I can talk to the people who grew it. I often learn new ways to cook a vegetable. Prices are fair, especially near the end of the morning. The market also brings neighbours together. I usually meet a friend and stop for a coffee. It is the best part of my week. If your town has a market, visit it this weekend and buy something you have never cooked before."
